('518', '179', '<p>Waiting for approval from Dimitrios/Hussnain.</p><p>Last email sent: <b>RE: RE:(9) MENA - Coupon Codes Utilization Approval</b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\">Hi Marie,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\">From our side, we have informed CJ directly, and we have informed all subsidiaries on the upcoming changes, and asked them to update their partners.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\">Please go ahead and make the necessary changes, and please let us know before you publish the changes, to give a final update to the subs.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\">Thanks,</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\">Dimitrios</span></p>', '1', '1', '2026-07-01 16:09:53', '2026-07-01 16:09:53'),
